#7000
Traveling The Opium Road~
This cobblestone road cuts through the heartland of the continent. To each
side of you wild poppies grow unchecked along the hills. The air is perfumed
by their sweet scent and the numerous amount of travellers tell you this is
the heart of commerce of the Empire.  To the west is the great city of
Sahardin.
